[{"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:52:37Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Nacreous", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:52:52Z", "username": "Shubhankar", "text": "Superb", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:00Z", "username": "Shubhankar", "text": "Yaad hi nahi aa raha tha", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:04Z", "username": "Shubhankar", "text": "😅", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:07Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Nacreous Clouds (or Polar Stratospheric Clouds)is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:10Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Mother of pearl helped!", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:20Z", "username": "Shubhankar", "text": "Yes main bhi usi se relate kar raha tha", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:26Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "12. This one is not defined first by texture or rain but by event: it is born from violence, fire, eruption, or detonation rather than ordinary sky-making. Its name combines the idea of a storm-bearing vertical tower with one of heat or flame, and it has accompanied everything from volcanic eruptions to modern warfare. In visual memory, it often looks less like weather than like history becoming visible. What is it?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:40Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Volcanic cloud", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:53:49Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Don’t remember if there a scientific name", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:17Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Pyrocumulonimbus is correct", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:28Z", "username": "Shubhankar", "text": "This is new", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:32Z", "username": "మాन$", "text": "Last\n13. Its modern scientific use is surprisingly recent compared with many of the older Latin forms. The name derives from the idea of waves, and its recognition reflects a sky that appears to ripple, break, or curl like a sea above rather than below. It is one of those categories that feels as if poetry existed before classification finally caught up. What is it?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:32Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Oh yes!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:44Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Has the connect been answered?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:50Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Yes", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:54Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "It’s clouds", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:54:58Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "If not. Are all these the clouds of which cloud cover advantage cannot be taken", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:55:02Z", "username": "Shubhankar", "text": "Types of clouds", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-06T05:55:13Z", "username": "Chinmay Mehta", "text": "Not that complex 🤣", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]